The  driver  provides  support for USB Ethernet adapters based on
the ASIX  Electronics  AX88178a  USB  2.0  and  AX88179  USB  3.0
chipsets including the following: The driver supports the follow‐
ing  media  types: Enable autoselection of the media type and op‐
tions (this is the default).  The user can manually override  the
autoselected  mode  by  adding  media  options to the appropriate
file.  Set 10Mbps operation.  Set 100Mbps (Fast Ethernet)  opera‐
tion.   Set  1000Mbps (Gigabit Ethernet) operation.  For more in‐
formation on configuring this device, see  See  for  diagnostics.
